+- [x] Implement an allowlisted public review response containing only review id, rating, description, date, and reviewer first name; update the public review conversion and avoid customer email/address serialization.
+- [x] Enforce whole-number ratings 1–5, authenticated customer ownership, and one-review-per-customer/product on the authenticated create endpoint; map failures to 400, 403, and 409 before persistence.
+- [x] Implement product-constrained merchant PUT and DELETE lookup/mutation behavior and map missing or foreign reviews to 404.
