+Merchant update and delete endpoints SHALL operate only on an existing review belonging to the path product, and SHALL return HTTP 404 Not Found when no such review exists.
+
+#### Scenario: Merchant updates a matching review
+- **WHEN** a merchant sends PUT `/api/v1/private/products/{id}/reviews/{reviewId}` for an existing review of that product
